# World 1: 3D-Only Click-to-Draw Studio (Points -> Lines -> Faces)
# Capability mask: MODE_3D, PERM_DRAW granted at boot, PERM_MODE_SWITCH revoked.
# Click the ground to place points; click the first point again or press F to close into a face.
mode 3d
tab 0
draw 1
sheet 1
ground z
smooth 0
solid Tetrahedron -520 260 0 yaw 25000 spin 1 inf 0 glow 1 bounce 0.45
solid Octahedron 520 260 0 yaw 45000 spin 1 inf 0 glow 1 bounce 0.68
solid Cone -520 -260 0 yaw 15000 spin 1 inf 0 glow 1 bounce 0.56
solid Torus 520 -260 0 yaw 65000 spin 1 inf 0 glow 1 bounce 0.82
cube 0 340 0 yaw 38000 spin 1 inf 0 glow 0 bounce 0.50
